{"id":"conflicto","lemma":"conflicto","pos":"noun","rank":2759,"glosses":["conflict"],"ipa":"/konˈfliɡto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"conflictos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-conflicto.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Por qué es necesario resolver conflictos?","en":"Why is it necessary to resolve conflicts?","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"necessary, requisite"},{"g":"to resolve"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"why, for what reason"]]},{"text":"No me gustan los conflictos.","en":"I don't like conflict.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Había que hacer frente a aquel conflicto.","en":"The problem had to be faced.","words":[{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"that"},null,null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"that (over there"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"to face up"]]},{"text":"Parece que él no sabe acerca de mi conflicto con mi padre.","en":"He seems not to be aware of the conflict between my father and me.","words":[{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"he"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},null,null,{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"father, parent"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"about, concerning"]]},{"text":"El movimiento separatista está creando conflicto dentro del país.","en":"The separatist movement is creating conflict within the country.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"movement"},{"g":"breakaway, separatist"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to create","l":"crear"},null,{"g":"inside"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"country"}]}]}